TITLE:: CompressorPanel
summary:: a compressor's controls as one view
categories:: Libraries>Compressor
related:: Classes/Compressor, Classes/CompressorGUI, Classes/CompressorCurveView, Classes/CompressorHistoryView, Classes/CompressorMeterView, Classes/ParaEQPanel

DESCRIPTION::
What every window that shows a compressor is built from: its own window, the
master chain in ServerView.

code::
 [x] comp on  preset [glue v] [name  ][save][delete] [copy][paste]   mode [down v] detector [rms v]
 +-----------------+ +-------------------------------+ +----+
 | transfer curve  | | in / out / gain, 8 seconds    | |bars|
 +-----------------+ +-------------------------------+ +----+
  thresh  ratio  knee  attack release  look  range  mix  gain [x] auto  link
 sidechain [input v] bus [ 0 ][name v] [audition]         [x] sc eq [show eq]
 (the sidechain eq's panel, folded away until asked for)
::

The boxes under the knobs read in the units the reader thinks in -
milliseconds for the times, percent for mix and link. With BusManager installed
the sidechain row grows a dropdown of bus names.

code::
panel = CompressorPanel(comp);
window.layout = VLayout(panel.view, hints.view);
panel.hints = hints;
panel.running = true;         // meters, and the sidechain eq's analysis when shown
panel.remove;                 // in window.onClose
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
ARGUMENT:: comp
ARGUMENT:: parent

